 ;; core module (squint-cljs/core.js, a cljs.core-shaped runtime), run on Node — ClojureScript's Node adapters with
 ;; eve.host's functions over that core module (adapters/core/squint) and squint's types twist (adapters/types/squint);
 ;; the current thread only (thread/squint: cherry's threadless adapter with an empty binding frame — squint has
