 ;; ValueScript (vs compile, then wasmtime; bb test:vs): slab I/O, regions, the allocator, the codec, the HAMT
 ;; functions; eve.core is babashka's protocols adapter and eve.types translates a type onto it (VS's core never reaches
 ;; a deftype's interfaces). eve/deftype's expansion waits on a builder carrying EM4's held half (VS's analyzer lets a
 ;; namespace replace a macro named deftype; its macro evaluator runs macro-time atoms and 64-bit integer words).
 ;; eve.crypto is crypto/vs: the kernel's
 ;; SHA-256, the big-integer and edwards25519 rows over VS's BigInt tower, the rest portable (eve.net.portable-crypto).
 ;; eve.http is http/vs: the vs.host bridge's fetch (a program run under vs-term --bridge, Node, Workers; bb test:vs-http);
 ;; eve.http-server is http-server/vs: the bridge's HTTP in, the host's listener (Node's vs-serve-node.mjs, Workers;
 ;; bb test:vs-serve)
 :vs   ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/slab-io/vs/src" "adapters/http/vs/src" "adapters/http-server/vs/src" "adapters/core/vs/src" "adapters/completion/clojure/src" "adapters/slab/heap/src"
        "adapters/region/vs/src" "adapters/encoding/vs/src" "adapters/int32/vs/src" "adapters/codec/byte-array/src"
        "adapters/process/vs/src" "adapters/gc/none/src" "adapters/coll/protocols/src" "adapters/types/vs/src" "adapters/crypto/vs/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src" "adapters/thread/vs/src" "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]
 ;; glojure, run as glj-eve (impls/glojure/build.sh: glojure v0.7.22 with eve's Go packages and its completion's
 ;; patches): its regions over eve's Go region package, its core completed (deftype, reify, satisfies?, ...), eve's
 ;; types as records on eve.core's protocols (babashka's coll adapter), the network atom's adapters among them
 :glj  ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/slab-io/protocol/src" "adapters/http/go/src" "adapters/crypto/go/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src"
        "adapters/core/clojure/src" "adapters/completion/glojure/src" "adapters/coll/protocols/src" "adapters/slab/heap/src" "adapters/region/glojure/src"
        "adapters/encoding/go/src" "adapters/int32/portable/src" "adapters/codec/byte-array/src" "adapters/process/go/src" "adapters/gc/glojure/src" "adapters/thread/glojure/src"
        "adapters/types/glojure/src" "adapters/http-server/go/src" "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]
 ;; jank (0.1-alpha; apt package jank 0.1-noble, 2026-10-28): its core completed by adapters/completion/jank (deftype,
 ;; defprotocol, defrecord, reify, extend-type, the unchecked-* ops, = and hash reaching a type's own, clojure.edn),
 ;; eve's types as one C++ object each on eve.core's protocols (babashka's coll adapter as jank reads it:
 ;; adapters/coll/jank), regions, slab-io, typed-view, encoding, process, int32 and crypto over C++ (cpp/raw) in
 ;; their adapters; the codec and the thread host likewise over C++ in adapters/codec/jank and
 ;; adapters/thread/jank (wired 2026-11-12, Bucket D closer: eve.thread-host-test 13/55 and the codec
 ;; fixture+compat suites 12/338 green on the native adapters; before that the row carried the
 ;; inbuilt codec/byte-array and thread/none). Run under LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 (jank's lexer reads source through the locale)
 :jank ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/slab-io/jank/src" "adapters/core/clojure/src" "adapters/completion/jank/src" "adapters/coll/jank/src"
        "adapters/slab/heap/src" "adapters/region/jank/src" "adapters/typed-view/jank/src" "adapters/encoding/jank/src" "adapters/int32/jank/src"
        "adapters/codec/jank/src" "adapters/process/jank/src" "adapters/gc/jank/src" "adapters/thread/jank/src" "adapters/types/jank/src"
        "adapters/crypto/jank/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src" "adapters/http/jank/src" "adapters/http-server/jank/src"
        "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]
 ;; let-go, run as lg-eve (impls/let-go: let-go v1.13.0 with eve's Go package, evenative — `go build -o
 ;; target/lg-eve/lg-eve .` there): http, crypto and encoding over lg-eve's Go natives (evenative/host.go), the
 ;; process feature's clock, entropy and stdin. Eve memory lands with the direct port (lane-m/eve-letgo): the
 ;; region over evenative/region.go's natives (heap + MAP_SHARED file regions, i32/i64 atomics, wait/notify,
 ;; msync), the portable slab and collection roots, goroutine threads (thread/letgo — real parallelism, no
 ;; binding-frame conveyance); Eve's types are its own on this seat (types/letgo — runtime-constructor
 ;; deftype/defrecord, methods over extend-type onto eve.core's protocols); the disk tier's journal is eve.jlog
 ;; (the mmapped commit log, one cljc implementation over the region: no per-host journal adapter).
 :lg   ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/slab-io/protocol/src" "adapters/http/letgo/src" "adapters/http-server/letgo/src" "adapters/crypto/letgo/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src" "adapters/core/clojure/src"
        "adapters/completion/letgo/src" "adapters/coll/protocols/src" "adapters/slab/heap/src" "adapters/region/letgo/src"
        "adapters/encoding/letgo/src" "adapters/int32/portable/src" "adapters/codec/byte-array/src" "adapters/process/letgo/src" "adapters/gc/letgo/src"
        "adapters/thread/letgo/src" "adapters/types/letgo/src" "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]
 ;; ClojureDart, compiled to Dart and run by the Dart VM (a plain Dart program, no Flutter):
 ;; the network client's adapters — the chat seat's closure — over Dart's typed lists (eve.host, eve.encoding),
 ;; dart:io's synchronous socket (eve.http) and process calls, package:crypto's digests and Dart's BigInt (eve.crypto),
 ;; and the portable int32 row; and eve's memory-level half: the inbuilt slab I/O over a region/dart region
 ;; (a MAP_SHARED mapping + libatomic over dart:ffi, its Dart half the eve_region package a program adds by
 ;; path), the heap slab, coll and types on cljd.core's protocols (types/dart is the compiler's own Clojure:
 ;; ClojureDart evaluates macros on the JVM, and its eve.types realizes each type as a cljd deftype through
 ;; eve.deftype-proto.sio's ISlabIO generators), the journal eve.jlog over that region, and an
 ;; http-server over dart:io's HttpServer. Threads are still thread/none (one isolate serves a body).
 ;; ClojureDart reads a root's .cljd and .cljc files with the :cljd feature
 :cljd ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/http/dart/src" "adapters/crypto/dart/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src" "adapters/core/dart/src" "adapters/completion/dart/src"
        "adapters/encoding/dart/src" "adapters/int32/portable/src" "adapters/codec/byte-array/src"
        "adapters/process/dart/src" "adapters/gc/dart/src" "adapters/thread/dart/src"
        "adapters/slab-io/protocol/src" "adapters/region/dart/src" "adapters/slab/heap/src"
        "adapters/coll/dart/src" "adapters/types/dart/src"
        "adapters/http-server/dart/src"
        ;; the compiler's own Clojure, a JVM (ClojureDart evaluates macros
        ;; there and its macro-time code — the deftype machinery's type-id
        ;; and name-hash computation — runs eve's scalar stack there):
        ;; the JVM's adapters, .clj/.cljc files ClojureDart's loader never
        ;; reads for a namespace a dart root carries (its ns-to-paths are
        ;; .cljd then .cljc; the .cljc here are the ones no dart root
        ;; shadows). types' JVM half is types/dart's own types.clj — the
        ;; realization eve.types must offer a cljd build's macros is the
        ;; dart one, not types/jvm's. As ClojureScript's row, in full:
        "adapters/core/clojure/src" "adapters/completion/clojure/src"
        "adapters/coll/jvm/src" "adapters/region/jvm-varhandle/src" "adapters/encoding/java/src"
        "adapters/int32/jvm/src" "adapters/process/java/src" "adapters/gc/java/src" "adapters/thread/jvm/src" "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]
 ;; not a shipped host: babashka on the minimal set and the inbuilt set only (doc/adopting-eve-minimal.md) — its four
 ;; host roots (region, encoding, process, types), then the nine portable ones every host may take as they are. What a
 ;; new language starts from; bb test:bb-minimal runs the shared suites on it (all but eve.net's, which need http)
 :bb-minimal ["apps/network-atoms/src" "adapters/region/jvm-nio-lock/src" "adapters/encoding/java/src" "adapters/process/java/src" "adapters/gc/java/src"
              "adapters/types/bb/src"
              "adapters/slab-io/protocol/src" "adapters/core/clojure/src" "adapters/completion/bb/src" "adapters/completion/clojure/src"
              "adapters/coll/protocols/src" "adapters/slab/heap/src" "adapters/int32/portable/src"
              "adapters/codec/byte-array/src" "adapters/crypto/portable/src" "adapters/thread/none/src" "adapters/flat-io/portable/src"]}
